WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:01.740
- What about personally,
what plans do you have

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:04.291
for the holidays other
than watching the movie?

00:00:04.291 --> 00:00:06.960
- (laughs) I'm definitely
gonna watch the movie

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:08.790
and then, you know, I'm
gonna be honest with you,

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:12.930
this year I was, I have dreaded
this year more than anything

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:15.030
since my divorce, because
this was gonna be the year

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:18.570
that I didn't have my
kids Christmas morning.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:23.570
But I've never looked forward
to a day more now than ever.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:27.570
I now, I'm gonna get my kids
on Christmas day at noon

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:30.120
and Santa is gonna
actually come the next day,

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:31.830
so we're gonna celebrate
Christmas the next day

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:33.870
so I don't miss out on, you know,

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:35.280
their little feet pitter-patterning,

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.710
coming down and seeing
the presents from Santa.

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:40.770
So I'm excited to create
our own memory this year

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:42.080
and I'm really looking forward to that.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:42.913
(audience claps)

00:00:42.913 --> 00:00:44.490
- Oh, that's awesome.

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:47.293
I'm so glad that worked out right there.

